msgid "is a typical representative in providing and introducing to consumers the best nutritional values of Vietnamese cuisine, especially products made from rice – a traditional and well-known ingredient of Vietnam. We aim to bring you distinctive product experiences and unique flavors such as rice vermicelli, fresh rice noodles, dried rice noodles, dried pho noodles, fresh pho noodles, glass noodles (mung bean noodles), rice paper for spring rolls, and more."
